            <span class="rounded-full accent-bg px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold" style="color: #07090c;">Pipe Basics</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-theme-muted">8 min read</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-theme-primary group-hover:underline">Pipe Schedule Chart Explained</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-theme-secondary">What pipe schedule numbers mean, how to read the chart, and when to use SCH 10/40/80/160/XXS.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/blog/how-to-choose-flange-class/" class="card card-accent group block">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="rounded-full accent-bg px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold" style="color: #07090c;">Flange Selection</span>
