              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-theme-secondary">ISO 9001, PED, and ASME U&amp;U2 certified factories. MTC 3.1 material traceability on every shipment.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-5">
              <div class="mb-3 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl accent-bg" style="color: #07090c;">
                <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-theme-primary">24h Quote Turnaround</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-theme-secondary">Send drawings or specs — get factory quotes within 24 hours. Expedited quotes for urgent projects.</p>
